Root explicitly delegates full Binder17/C20/P16/nine-output/source-binder/architecture/eight-argv closure to a genuine owner_docs actual Source audit externally selected BEFORE physical INIT, and to different actual BoundPool20 before capture. Constructor does not directly validate every17 field or architecture/binder relation. Pipeline INIT precedes its trust/P16 step and its later pointer/JSON authentication must not be described as direct full17 or pre-INIT enforcement. This review supplies no global admission proof or actual prerequisite acceptance.

The architecture keeps external SHA selection19, strict JSON/typed fields, ordinary8MiB input cap, checker262144 and U/composer/source-output131072 caps, output size/hash computation before first write and no approval/READY/GO/INIT/capture/Core/test-result writer. Lower96888 is Source-only arithmetic, never actual total or fit. Publication is individually create-once staging/rename without batch rollback; partial outputs remain consumed. The18 causal controls are plans only and their qualified AST-negative dominance gap is retained. Actual models/selection/fit remain null. Correct all four groups in one distinct successor, then obtain a complete different review before Root actual assembly or any capture timer.
